The '''Pipe''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

Despite being available in the [[First Sea]], Pipe is surprisingly fun to use in PvP, mostly used for trolling. 

==Obtainment==
The Pipe can be bought at the cost of {{Money|100,000}} from the [[Sword Dealer of the East]], who is located at the [[Frozen Village]] in the [[First Sea]].

