==Trivia==
* Even though the Pipe is a [[sword]], its shape and name have no sword-like characteristics at all.
* '''[X] Earth Smash''' (old move) was similar to [[Iron Mace]]'s [X] ability.
* The Pipe's model prior to [[Updates/24|Update 24]] was an actual pipe. The name for the weapon after the update had remained unchanged which makes the item description make no sense, despite its updated appearance. This can be confusing for new players who are unfamiliar with the old Pipe model.
* The Pipe has a similar moveset to [[Dragon Talon]], as {{Ability|Z}} and {{Ability|X}} are similar to Dragon Talon's {{Ability|Dragon Talon|Z}} and {{Ability|Dragon Talon|X}}, respectively.
* {{Ability|X}} sounds similar to that of [[Sound]]'s [Z] Move, {{Ability|Sound|Z}}.

